  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "お疲れ様っすー！\r\nえっと～……はじめまして、ですよね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004040030,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────あ、はい！　そうですー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400404/1024004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "今日、ゲスト出演させてもらいます！\r\nよろしくお願いしまっす！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004040040,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "あー……そうだったんですね！\r\nすみません、こちらからご挨拶に行くべきだったのにー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400404/1024004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "そんなそんな！\r\n準レギュラー様にそんなことさせられませんって！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004040050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "なんですー、その言い方ー\r\nなんか引っかかるなー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400404/1024004040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "あー、すみませんっ！\r\n悪気は……ちょっとあります！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004040060,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "え、ちょ……悪気あるんですー？\r\n確信犯、こわー",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400404/1024004040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "────あははっ\r\n今日も俺、今日が最後！　ってつもりでやりますんで！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "若干、キャラかぶっちゃうかもしれないんですけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "新人お笑い",
    "text": "その辺りは、もう……\r\n懐ふかーく受け止めてもらえるとありがたいっす！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004040070,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────うわー\r\nナチュラルにプレッシャーかけてくるなー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
